    technical_en: 'Llama 2\'s pretraining uses a standard decoder-only Transformer, with the engineering effort concentrated in data and alignment. It trained on 2 trillion tokens of public data, deliberately excluding sites known to contain personal information, with a 4096 context; the 70B model used grouped-query attention for inference efficiency. Alignment came in two stages: supervised fine-tuning on about 27,000 high-quality instruction dialogues, then RLHF with a reward model and PPO; Meta\'s paper documented the safety process in detail, from red-teaming to harmfulness scoring and the helpfulness-versus-refusal trade-off. Compared with the GPT family, Llama 2\'s raw capability was not superior, roughly matching GPT-3.5, but it officially delivered the combination of commercial use, local deployment, and fine-tuning, and that combination was the product.',
    impact_zh: 'Llama 2 是开源大模型运动的制度性起点：它把此前灰色地带的「权重泄漏 + 社区微调」变成了官方支持的正规军，一年内催生了数以万计的衍生模型与完整的开源工具链（vLLM、llama.cpp、量化生态）。商业上，它给所有闭源厂商施加了价格压力——GPT-3.5 API 此后数次大幅降价，「开源追平闭源一代」的节奏从此成为行业预期。它同时也树立了「开放权重 ≠ 开源」的许可证范式，引发关于 OSI 定义与真正开放标准的持续讨论。局限同样清晰：英文中心的数据构成、对中文等语言支持有限、许可证的使用限制条款，以及 Meta 对后续 Llama 3 更严格的「研究优先」策略，都说明开放程度始终是战略变量而非道德承诺。',
